## Why This Is Asked
Tests CSS layout mastery, responsive behavior, and accessible animation without JS. Enforces separation of rails and content, and CSS-only state management via a toggle.

## Key Concepts
- CSS Grid responsive layouts
- CSS-only toggles with input[type=checkbox]
- Fixed vs collapsible rails
- Accessible motion: prefers-reduced-motion and focus-visible
- Pure-CSS sparkline visuals

## Code Example
```html
